f logo is 96 tall, try logoInst.rescale(0.5) again after layout, or use resize(84.5,48) — for image fill, resize stretches image (IMAGE fill has scaleMode; if FILL it crops; the fill might be FILL so stretch is fine).\n\nAlso, actually maybe better: header height fixed 88: counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED', resize(1440, 88), counterAxisAlignItems CENTER. Content taller than 88 would overflow — need logo actually 48.\n\nLet me inspect current state first.","signature":"cb01ba2a4e654f2c825d2ef7"}],"id":"2c2922ac-652d-4e76-bff9-883b0c4f4839","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f27098c1-0b8f-45bd-83b8-e941b77614a9","uuid":"55b8f559-58c4-43a8-bc16-627939df20e8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:19:27.923Z","thinking_duration_ms":20766}
