nstance root allowed. Initials text child override allowed. \n\nExperience_Item width: 1160 fixed; content col STRETCH.\n\nRole line: set characters then find index of \" at \" from the role part. e.g. \"Lead Software Engineer at Searchlight\": role part \"Lead Software Engineer\" ends at 22; \" at Searchlight\" from 22 to end. setRangeFills(22, len, gray). For e2: \"Software Engineer at Meridian Social\" — \"Software Engineer\" 17 chars → from 17. e3: \"Junior Software Engineer at Orchard Computing\" — 24 chars → from 24.\n\nDates text: \"Nov 2019 – Present\" (en dash U+2013 as in brief).\n\nStep 5 code: create Company_Mark set (3 variants), Experience_Item component, Experience section with 3 instances + dividers. Also gradientTransform: vertical top→bottom: [[0, 1, 0], [-1, 0, 1]]. Diagonal 45°: [[0.7071, 0.7071, -0.2071], [-0.7071, 0.7071, 0.5]] — I'll just use vertical for all; OC diagonal fine too. Keep vertical.","signature":"3ab0cfb303464269ba1df69a"}],"id":"8b21e4b9-2466-4b88-8693-618fdb983e07","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f27098c1-0b8f-45bd-83b8-e941b77614a9","uuid":"f86eff3f-4423-4cc3-a718-4ebb4526d98c","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:26:18.294Z","thinking_duration_ms":34501}
