h → all white).\n\nFix: inspect Logo_X 3:11 children: if it has a background rect (larger) + glyph, set background rect fill to transparent/removed and glyph to #E8E8EE... but wait — if glyph is dark-on-white, removing bg and making glyph light works.\n\nLet me inspect 3:11 and 3:12 structure with fills.","signature":"2da10188c12247ccafa798b1"}],"id":"ff8fa730-957a-4a29-8366-4d0a8101e7f6","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f27098c1-0b8f-45bd-83b8-e941b77614a9","uuid":"32d6007e-3848-4528-83ba-fb35f8c1e6b2","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:49:22.959Z","thinking_duration_ms":19421}
